From: mscharged-port native integration
Subject: [PATCH] Admit the literal original FEDPD task in the selected frontend diagnostic
Upstream-base: fda4bebccdd24236eda3d27763840471d3b00f32

Temporary diagnostic exclusion retirement only. Preserve the existing task
constructor, AddTasks statement position, priority13 and state mask5.
Normal and console projections are unchanged. No host pointer dispatch.

diff --git a/src/Game/main.cpp b/src/Game/main.cpp
index 3688814..72b79f7 100644
--- a/src/Game/main.cpp
+++ b/src/Game/main.cpp
@@ -793,9 +793,7 @@ static void AddTasks()
 #if !defined(MSCHARGED_DIAGNOSTIC_FRONTEND_TASK_CADENCE)
     nlTaskManager::AddTask(&networkUpdateTask, 17, (u32)-1);
 #endif // unqualified unrelated task registration remains omitted
-#if !defined(MSCHARGED_DIAGNOSTIC_FRONTEND_TASK_CADENCE)
     nlTaskManager::AddTask(&feDPDTask, 13, 5);
-#endif // unqualified unrelated task registration remains omitted
 #if !defined(MSCHARGED_DIAGNOSTIC_FRONTEND_TASK_CADENCE)
     nlTaskManager::AddTask(
         &flashMemoryTask, 13, (u32)-1);
